      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "1d10+10 bludgeoning,1d8 electricity, DC 32 basic Fortitude save\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Instrument of Retribution",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "occult",
        "polymorph"
      ],
      "text": "The xiuh coatl transforms into any simple or martial weapon. The weapon is always a +2 greater striking flaming shock weapon and can be of any size, chosen by the xiuh coatl when they transform. In weapon form, the xiuh coatl gains Hardness equal to that of the weapon into which they transform, and they retain their Hit Points, saving throws, senses, telepathy, and traits while in weapon form. The xiuh coatl can Sustain to revert to their normal form."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Volcanic Lightning Breath",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "fire",
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "The xiuh coatl breathes a gout of flame and lightning in an 80-foot line that deals 5d8 electricity damage and 5d8 fire damage (DC 32 basic Reflex save save). The xiuh coatl can't use Volcanic Lightning Breath again for 1d4 rounds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Wrap in Coils",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The xiuh coatl has a Medium or smaller creature Grabbed or Restrained in their jaws\n\n---\nEffect The mix coatl moves the creature into their coils, freeing their jaws to make attacks, and then uses Constrict against the creature. The mix coatl can hold as many creatures in their coils as will fit in their space."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Xiuh Coatl Venom",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "holy",
        "poison"
      ],
      "text": "To unholy creatures, this is a curse instead of a poison and deals spirit damage instead of poison damage\n\nSaving Throw DC 32 Fortitude save\n\nMaximum Duration 6 rounds\n\nStage 1 2d8 poison damage and Enfeebled 1 (1 round)\n\nStage 2 2d10 poison damage, enfeebled 1, and –5-foot status penalty to all Speeds (1 round)\n\nStage 3 3d8 poison damage, Enfeebled 2, and –10-foot status penalty to all Speeds (1 round)\n\n---\nAgainst unholy\n\nSaving Throw DC 32 Fortitude save\n\nMaximum Duration 6 rounds\n\nStage 1 2d8 spirit damage and Enfeebled 1 (1 round)\n\nStage 2 2d10 spirit damage, enfeebled 1, and –5-foot status penalty to all Speeds (1 round)\n\nStage 3 3d8 spirit damage, Enfeebled 2, and –10-foot status penalty to all Speeds (1 round)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
